    {
      "text": "Fig 2, 'Information flow across supply chain processes'. Eight rounded boxes: forecasting and planning, sourcing and contract management, order management, traceability, procurement, warehouse management, transportation and dispensing. Two-headed arrows join them, showing that information flows both ways between the processes; warehouse management is the most connected box.",
